{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1362017-rail-gun-endless-frontiers-v-1-needs-clarification","id":1362017,"title":"Rail Gun (Endless Frontiers V.1) needs clarification","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-19T16:40:28-08:00","id":1362017,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Rail Gun (Endless Frontiers V.1) needs clarification","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">In Endless Frontiers V1, the Rail Gun is detailed ... just not very well.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It states the weapon is treated as a +1 scale bigger than the targeted ship - shouldn't it be +1 scale bigger than the ship it is on?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Rail Gun specifies it is a specific weapon, yet has no tags. Is it meant to be a weapon tag (like the VARG weapon tag &quot;Major&quot;)?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">There are restrictions about targeting and increased difficulty targeting smaller ships. This makes sense, but I wonder if it is meant to be a weapon tag with good and bad rolled together.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Suggestion ...<br /> Rail Gun (2) (Weapon Modifier - needs to apply to a vehicle's Coil Gun)<br /> Upgrade a standard Coil Gun option to the following:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Take all the bad from the Rail Gun description, and treat it as a Coil Gun with +1 Scale. It automatically gains the Mount tag, and cannot be unmounted without a refit.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm eager to clear up the rules on this and would appreciate any help in the matter.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25907-dread-skavos","name":"Dread Skavos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T23:43:17-08:00","id":1362061,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the feedback. I think a few details got missed in editing as I was getting the book ready. I\u2019ll let people know when it\u2019s updated. \ud83d\udc4d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T12:22:17-08:00","id":1362189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dread Skavos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyx